0&s=3493b6fc1840f6f47cdae2725066c2e6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e95f96bc/uploads/origins/dd757bdf-e69f-407a-bbac-83aceebc8fa9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ec8b80937441d7944929911c3ded066e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "https://skeb.jp/@KMMYmymy/works/268\n今回も前回の続きのようなものをお願いします\n\n■キャラクター\n七つの魔剣が支配するのミシェーラ＝マクファーレンとナナオ＝ヒビヤ\n\n■シチュエーション\n四つん這いでお尻を竿役（主人公）に向けるミシェーラとナナオ\n\n■構図\n前回から更にエスカレートしてミシェーラとナナオの二人が四つん這いになり主人公にお尻を向けておかずを提供しているような感じでお願いします\n2コマに割る感じで、二人の並んだお尻のコマと顔の方のコマがあると嬉しいです\n二人ともお尻を向けながらお互いの秘部を拡げさせている感じでお願いします\nミシェーラはナナオの秘部を拡げており、ナナオは場所を間違えてミシェーラのアナルに少し指を入れながら拡げている感じでお願いします\nナナオは少し恥ずかしそうに、ミシェーラはアナルに指を入れられて驚いている感じでお願いします\n\n主人公が二人のアナルにずぶっと人差し指を深く挿入している差分と、二人のお尻に精液をぶっかけている差分があると嬉しいです\nミシェーラの褐色肌とナナオの色白の肌の違いがわかる感じでお願いします", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@KMMYmymy/works/273", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 207455, "client_id": 2481432, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5b86d397/uploads/origins/36dd3233-9fd5-4545-a8d6-e4b84be1b1f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2db02224b23ad9d2e975c4593629109", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5b86d397/uploads/origins/36dd3233-9fd5-4545-a8d6-e4b84be1b1f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0e11f075ae4d5890b5054c67a8d4cb82", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Can you draw my character Rina? She is a kuudere assassin on the run. Rina has been captured and raped already. She has average breasts and thick thighs. She only has her gradient stockings remaining on. Rina managed to kill one of her captors and is hiding nearby as her slavers are searching for her. She is still bound in a futuristic metal cuffs, reducing her mobility. The collar either begins electrocuting or choking her. She is then surrounded and caught, with a hint of fear in her expressions. The slavers promise to rape her to the point where she will never think of escaping again.\n\nhttps://catbox.moe/c/ekifdr\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/125331438", "nc": 41, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@KMMYmymy/works/272", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d5b7749e/uploads/origins/2a233499-1022-4074-9b35-b478a41f6af8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=dda453572a48535cc99d78f6a1d21bc5", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 207455, "client_id": 259375, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 48, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@KMMYmymy/works/271", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dd0770d3/uploads/origins/bd50ddee-1766-4f52-9c8c-eb8d61a3567e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b1f6a91d3d10114cdf75eccba72b40bb", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 207455, "client_id": 909759, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@KMMYmymy/works/270", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce00bc21/uploads/or